   "source": [
    "#  Olist Delivery Performance & Customer Satisfaction Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "##  Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "Delivery performance is a critical driver of customer satisfaction in e-commerce. Delays in order fulfillment can negatively impact user experience and platform trust.\n",
    "\n",
    "This project analyzes the Olist Brazilian e-commerce dataset to evaluate delivery timelines, identify key causes of delays, and measure their impact on customer reviews.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "##  Problem Statement\n",
    "\n",
    "The objective of this analysis is to:\n",
    "\n",
    "* Quantify delivery delays across orders\n",
    "* Identify root causes (seller processing vs logistics)\n",
    "* Analyze the impact of delays on customer satisfaction\n",
    "* Recommend actionable improvements\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "##  Approach\n",
    "\n",
    "* Merged multiple datasets (orders, customers, sellers, reviews)\n",
    "* Created key metrics such as delivery time, delay, and late delivery rate\n",
    "* Performed root cause and regional analysis\n",
    "* Evaluated the relationship between delays and review scores\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "##  Key Metrics\n",
    "\n",
    "* Delivery Time\n",
    "* Delay (Actual vs Expected)\n",
    "* Late Delivery Rate\n",
    "* Processing Time & Shipping Time\n",
    "* Customer Review Score\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "cf47ca06",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "\n",
    "from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n",
    "from sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\n",
    "from sklearn.metrics import accuracy_score, classification_report"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "c26847ec",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "orders = pd.read_csv(\"olist_orders_dataset.csv\")\n",
    "customers = pd.read_csv(\"olist_customers_dataset.csv\")\n",
    "order_items = pd.read_csv(\"olist_order_items_dataset.csv\")\n",
    "reviews = pd.read_csv(\"olist_order_reviews_dataset.csv\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "583fb340",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Dataset shape: (114092, 24)\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "df = orders.merge(customers, on=\"customer_id\", how=\"left\") \\\n",
    "           .merge(order_items, on=\"order_id\", how=\"left\") \\\n",
    "           .merge(reviews, on=\"order_id\", how=\"left\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Dataset shape:\", df.shape)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "375440f2",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "date_cols = [\n",
    "    \"order_purchase_timestamp\",\n",
    "    \"order_approved_at\",\n",
    "    \"order_delivered_customer_date\",\n",
    "    \"order_estimated_delivery_date\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "for col in date_cols:\n",
    "    df[col] = pd.to_datetime(df[col])\n",
    "\n",
    "df = df.dropna(subset=[\"order_delivered_customer_date\"])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "8232bfed",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df[\"delivery_time\"] = (\n",
    "    df[\"order_delivered_customer_date\"] - df[\"order_purchase_timestamp\"]\n",
    ").dt.days\n",
    "\n",
    "df[\"expected_time\"] = (\n",
    "    df[\"order_estimated_delivery_date\"] - df[\"order_purchase_timestamp\"]\n",
    ").dt.days\n",
    "\n",
    "df[\"delay\"] = df[\"delivery_time\"] - df[\"expected_time\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "df[\"is_late\"] = df[\"delay\"] > 0\n",
    "\n",
    "df[\"processing_time\"] = (\n",
    "    df[\"order_approved_at\"] - df[\"order_purchase_timestamp\"]\n",
    ").dt.days\n",
    "\n",
    "df[\"shipping_time\"] = (\n",
    "    df[\"order_delivered_customer_date\"] - df[\"order_approved_at\"]\n",
    ").dt.days"
   ]
  },
